WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.500
Three things have to
exist before week one.

2
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:07.776
First, two names: an executive sponsor,
who owns scope, funding and sequence,

3
00:00:07.776 --> 00:00:12.100
and a steward, who runs the
program and decides the first gate.

4
00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:14.450
Second, a server to hold the work.

5
00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:19.437
Third, a read-only account for the assessment,
with no administrator rights at all.

6
00:00:19.437 --> 00:00:21.451
The names may already exist.

7
00:00:21.451 --> 00:00:26.775
Federal policy already required a zero
trust lead and an identity governance group,

8
00:00:26.775 --> 00:00:29.437
so build from those
people, not beside them.

9
00:00:29.437 --> 00:00:31.100
Next, that server.
